  "headline": "President Prabowo Expected To Submit Vice Presidential Nominees",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo To Propose New Vice Presidential Nominees",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto is expected to submit two vice presidential candidate names by November 25 following deliberations on potential successors.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Coordinating Minister Yusril Ihza Mahendra confirmed that President Prabowo must propose two vice presidential candidates by November 25.",
    "Gerindra party officials indicated that the President will finalize the selection process after returning from his current overseas trip.",
    "Public discussion has highlighted various figures, including party members and regional leaders, as potential candidates for the position."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The search for a new vice president has intensified as officials confirm that President Prabowo Subianto will soon put forward his nominations. Coordinating Minister for Law, Human Rights, Immigration, and Correctional Affairs, Yusril Ihza Mahendra, stated that the deadline for submitting two candidates is November 25. Meanwhile, representatives from the Gerindra party have emphasized that the final decision rests solely with the President, who is expected to address the matter upon concluding his international engagements. Various names have surfaced in public discourse, ranging from internal Gerindra cadres like Sufmi Dasco Ahmad and Sugiono to regional figures such as Sri Sultan Hamengkubuwono X. Experts in regional autonomy have suggested that the incoming vice president should possess a strong understanding of decentralization and intergovernmental relations to effectively bridge the gap between central and local administration.",
